1. PURPOSE AND PERMITTED USE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BlackRoute-Web is a security auditing and attack surface topology framework
designed exclusively for authorized defensive auditing, professional vulnerability
assessments, infrastructure hardening, and authorized bug bounty research.

This software is strictly intended for lawful security testing where the
operator has obtained prior, explicit, written authorization from the legal
owner of the target domain, host, application, or network infrastructure.

UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES IS THIS SOFTWARE TO BE USED FOR MALICIOUS PURPOSES,
UNAUTHORIZED INTRUSION, DISTRIBUTED DENIAL OF SERVICE (DDOS), DATA EXFILTRATION,
SURVEILLANCE, RECONNAISSANCE AGAINST PROHIBITED TARGETS, HARASSMENT, OR ANY
ACTIVITY THAT VIOLATES LOCAL, STATE, FEDERAL, OR INTERNATIONAL LAWS, INCLUDING
BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE UNITED STATES COMPUTER FRAUD AND ABUSE ACT (CFAA - 18
U.S.C. § 1030).

